    "description": "<p>Creates a transparent, passable wall across three adjacent, unoccupied hexes. Enemies that pass through the wall take 4d6+ <span style=\"color:rgb(239, 230, 216);font-family:Signika, 'Palatino Linotype', sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgba(12, 12, 12, 0.9);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;display:inline !important;float:none\">{{math spellPower \"*\" 1}}</span> Indirect Magical Damage, are stopped from moving, and are subjected to a Will Test vs. Will Test. On a success, the target is Staggered for two turns. Ignores armor.</p>",
